{"type":"message","id":"94ad33a2","parentId":"cdcada7b","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:37:31.171Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is throwing a Cloudflare Worker error 1101 (which is a Workers runtime error). This might be a bug in the worker itself, or maybe the send endpoint requires different authentication. Let me try checking the history endpoint with the Bearer token format again but with verbose output to see more details about what's happening.\n\nActually wait - the GET requests worked fine with X-API-Key, but the POST is failing. Let me try with the Bearer token format for the POST.\n\nActually, the GET worked with Bearer token AND X-API-Key. Let me try POST with Bearer.\n\nWait - looking back:\n- GET with Authorization: Bearer → Unauthorized\n\n\n- GET with X-API-Key → worked fine\n- POST with Authorization: Bearer → Unauthorized\n- POST with X-API-Key → error 1101\n\nSo GET only accepts X-API-Key, but POST is throwing 1101 with X-API-Key and Unauthorized with Bearer. The Cloudflare Worker error suggests the request is actually reaching the server, but there's an internal issue preventing the POST from succeeding. Maybe the endpoint expects something different in the request body or headers. The 1101 error is a Workers specific error that indicates an uncaught exception in the worker code. This is a server-side issue with the Cloudflare Worker, not an authentication problem. My GET requests are working fine with X-API-Key authentication, but POST is failing with a 1101 error. The most likely culprit is a JavaScript exception in the worker's send handler—possibly triggered by a missing required field, invalid JSON in the request body, or an issue with how the environment is configured. I've tried various header and body combinations but keep hitting the same error, which suggests the problem lies with the worker itself rather than my request format.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-bddf7992-b43b-4dd6-abd7-aa7d29660a03","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 00:35 UTC\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19990,"output":469,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20715,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778978241330,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7ca6b89d-addb-40fc-9c70-360c8ef072c4"}}
