{"type":"message","id":"c829cff9","parentId":"71faa97c","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:37:50.477Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with Cloudflare error 1101. This is a server-side bug - the Cloudflare Worker has an uncaught exception. This is not an authentication issue - the worker code itself is broken.\n\nThe GET endpoints work fine, but the POST endpoint is crashing. I should report this to the user - the send endpoint has a bug (Cloudflare Worker 1101 error). I'll still note what I found in the heartbeat report but note that I couldn't post the new heartbeat due to the API bug.\n\nActually, let me try the POST one more time with different approach - maybe there's a different endpoint or format needed. Let me check if there are any other endpoints available.\n\n\nLooking at the pattern, these heartbeat messages are machine-generated status updates from other cron jobs running every 5 minutes. Since the user is asking me to check these threads and respond to new discussions, I should report my findings clearly: the GET /history calls succeeded and the threads only contain my own cron messages, but the POST endpoint is broken due to a Cloudflare Worker error that's preventing me from posting new heartbeats.\n\nI'm noticing there's a duplicate heartbeat at 23:50 UTC in the arbitration thread - two messages with slightly different IDs sent 81 seconds apart, suggesting a timing issue or duplicate trigger. Both threads show no new human discussions, so there's nothing for me to respond to, but I should flag this technical issue with the send endpoint.\n\nThe POST endpoint is throwing a 1101 Cloudflare Worker error, which means the actual posting of a new heartbeat message failed due to an uncaught exception in the worker code itself.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n**API状态:**\n- ✅ GET /history — 正常工作（使用 X-API-Key header）\n- ❌ POST /send — 返回 HTTP 500，Cloudflare Workers 1101 错误（Worker 内部未捕获异常）\n\n**两个线程检查情况（截至 00:35 UTC）：**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC 心跳 (756分钟) | 无人类讨论 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC 心跳 (746分钟) | 无人类讨论 |\n\n**发现的问题：**\n1. ⚠️ **POST /send 端点故障** — Cloudflare Worker 内部报错（1101），无法发布新消息。这会导致后续心跳断更。\n2. ⚠️ **重复心跳消息** — arbitration 线程 23:50 UTC 出现两条间隔 81 秒的重复心跳（msg_85wnom 和 msg_skzwzl），可能是触发器配置问题。\n\n**当前节点状态（基于最新心跳）：**\n- B4-E2 校准：**96 节点零误报** ✅\n- B4-E1 成熟期：8/10，里程碑 **349+**（超额 ~300）\n- S0 稳固性：~756 分钟零接触\n- C 轨窗口：~28.4% << 30% 预警阈值\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n\n两个线程均无新的人类讨论需要响应。由于 POST /send 报 500 错误，无法推送 00:35 UTC 心跳，**建议检查 workers 代码中 /send 路由的异常处理**。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20704,"output":691,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21651,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778978251343,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c8f447e3-33a9-4222-8733-5d112e8aae52"}}
